Subject: aura: Block root window deletion in
 WindowEventDispatcher::UpdateCapture

Callers of UpdateCapture (such as DesktopCaptureClient or
CaptureController) expect the root window and host to remain alive
during capture updates. Synchronous destruction of the host/root
window during OnCaptureLost() can lead to use-after-free.

This CL adds a ScopedDeleteBlocker for the root window in
WindowEventDispatcher::UpdateCapture to block re-entrant deletion of
the root window and its host, and adds a regression test.

Fixed=517661385
TAG=agy
